                                "sense_id": "1b7ba60e-aaa2-3494-bdae-e8944b4c19ed",
                                "text": "My problem, though, is that when he whips me, I resist going into subspace. He has to whip me for fifteen or twenty minutes before I even begin to feel any psychological effects."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2baf58b3-5d79-4e64-a36b-d05fb744b338",
                                "sense_id": "1b7ba60e-aaa2-3494-bdae-e8944b4c19ed",
                                "text": "When he was far gone into subspace, pain was enough to make him come."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
